# Anthropic API key — required for the AI meal parser & AI recipe features.
# Get yours at https://console.anthropic.com/
#
# SECURITY — keep credit-abuse blast radius small:
#  • Add this ONLY as a server-side secret (no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix) so it never
#    ships in the browser bundle. The /api/ai-* routes call Anthropic server-side.
#  • The AI routes require a logged-in Supabase user and rate-limit per account
#    (see src/lib/serverAuth.ts), so the endpoint can't be used as a free proxy.
#  • In the Anthropic Console set a hard monthly spend limit, and prefer a
#    dedicated Workspace key with its own low budget — a leaked or abused key
#    then can't cost more than that cap.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
